student at the school. She is a classmate of the main character and has the biggest breasts in her grade."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a beautiful girl who is popular not only in her class but also in the whole school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her family is a wealthy family, and she is disciplined as a young lady and has a strong sense of chastity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On the other hand, her body has grown up to be feminine, and she is at a loss as to why she attracts the attention of men."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was a member of the class representative committee with the main character at the previous school festival, and was surprised to see the dexterity of the main character's hands and the sophistication with which he made small objects."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18776"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園２年生。主人公のクラスメイトで学年一の巨乳をもち、清楚で性格も良くまた料理が得意という家庭的な一面をもち、クラスだけでなく学園全体で人気の高い美少女。実家は資産家でお嬢様としての躾をされていて、貞操観念は強い。しかしその反面、体の方は女性らしく育ってしまい、男性の視線を集めてしまうことに戸惑っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先の学園祭で主人公と一緒にクラス代表の委員をつとめており、その際に主人公の手先の器用さと、小物作りの精巧さをみて驚き、クラスの出し物をお願いしたのがきっかけで主人公と話すようになり、クラスメイトとして仲良くしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【部外秘設定】"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2788","sourceWorkId":"19967","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おはよう、杉田くん。今日も良い天気だね～♪"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園２年生。主人公のクラスメイトで学年一の巨乳をもち、清楚で性格も良く家庭的、学園全体で人気の高い美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家は資産家でお嬢様としての躾をされていて、貞操観念は強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その反面、体の方は女性らしく育ってしまい、男性の視線を集めてしまうことに戸惑っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先の学園祭で主人公と一緒にクラス代表の委員をつとめており、クラスメイトとして仲良くしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"202577"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2788","sourceWorkId":"19967","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2788","sourceWorkId":"19967","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（