popular idol whose fan club the main character is a member of."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her personality is cheerful and positive, and she is more like a girl you would like to have as a younger sister than an idol."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Originally, she was an idol from an unsuccessful agency that held small live shows, but her character and dance performances were picked up by TV and she began to gain popularity, and now she often appears on TV."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she has always valued her close contact with her fans, and her popularity is further enhanced by the fact that she holds live performances and handshake events, both large and small, to maintain a close relationship with her fans."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main character, who became a fan even before she became popular this way and enthusiastically supported her with handmade goods, is treated a little more specially than other fans and called \"Onii-san."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, this has not become a problem due to his cheerful and unpretentious character, and in fact, it has become a tradition at handshake events, where other fans take a favorable view of him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18777"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公がファンクラブに入っている人気アイドル。性格は明るくポジティブ、アイドルというよりも"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹になってほしい女の子、という感じ。元々はこじんまりとライブを開いていた売れない事務所のアイドルだったがそのキャラとダンスパフォーマンスなどがＴＶに取り上げられて人気が出始め、今ではＴＶに出演することも多い。しかし本人は身近なファンとのふれあいを大事にする路線で大小かかわらずライブや握手会を開催し、近い距離をたもっていることが更に人気を呼んでいる。そうやって人気がでる以前からファンとなり、手作りグッズなどで熱心に応援してくれていた主人公のことを、他のファンよりも少しだけ特別扱いして「おにいさん」と呼んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし本人の明るく飾らないキャラクターのせいか問題にはならず、むしろ他のファンにも好意的にとられていて、握手会イベントでの風物詩になっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2789","sourceWorkId":"19967","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもきてくれてありがとうございます、おにいさん！　ホントはダメなんですけど……今日の１曲目だけは、おにいさんだけにむけて、歌いますね♪"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公がファンクラブに入っている人気アイドル。性格は明るくポジティブな妹系女子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し前までは売れないアイドルだったが、そのキャラとダンスパフォーマンスなどがＴＶに取り上げられて人気が出始めた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし本人はファンとのふれあいを大事にし、近い距離をたもっていることが更に人気を呼んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人気がでる以前からファンとなり、熱心に応援してくれていた主人公のことを、他のファンよりも少しだけ特別扱いして「おにいさん」と呼んでいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"202578"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2789","sourceWorkId":"19967","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2789","sourceWorkId":"19967","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"148 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2789","sourceWorkId":"19967","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2789","sourceWorkId":"19967","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2789","sourceWorkId":"19967","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67bfd42562c9242542b345b5a409f82a163941fed765385a2971b0461e251dd4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/981b1cd81a21a8210aebd1b5a680515d0d4fe577a785c0b263692d9144716bfb.webp","width":95,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞森柚子","creatorId":"egs:creator:36244","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:36244","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:36244","name":"瑞森柚子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:219596:202578:25171:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"このえ ゆずこ","creatorId":"vndb:s995","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s995","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s995","name":"このえ ゆずこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:5673