racterId":"c18779"},"originalCharacterName":"富岡 沙織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"９０"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"９２"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"６０"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A celebrity housewife living in the protagonist's neighborhood."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her husband is a successful businessman who owns several venture companies. She rarely comes home and spends her time doing whatever she likes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Instead, she never misses out on socializing with her neighbors and has a good reputation around her as a well-mannered wife even though she is a celebrity and a wealthy person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She and the main character have met many times at the garbage dump and are familiar with each other."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"They have become friends enough to make small talk, such as when the protagonist helps her with the garbage."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18779"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の近所に住むセレブ主婦。夫はベンチャー企業をいくつも抱えるやり手の実業家で、家にはほとんど帰ってこず、本人は好きなことを好きなようにやって過ごしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その代わり、ご近所づきあいなどは欠かさず、セレブで資産家でも良く出来た奥さんとして周囲の評判はすこぶる良い。主人公ともゴミ捨て場で何度も顔を合わせており顔なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公がゴミ捨てを手伝うなど世間話をするくらいの仲になっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2791","sourceWorkId":"19967","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あら悠真くん、今帰り？　いつもゴミ捨て手伝ってくれて悪いわねぇ……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の近所に住むセレブ主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫はベンチャー企業をいくつも抱えるやり手の実業家で、家にはほとんど帰ってこないため、本人は好きなように日々過ごしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text"